Subject: [PATCH] collab: host auto-started RPC sessions without a terminal

Use the existing controller, encrypted host, registry publisher and guest
capability checks in RPC mode. Enable interactive prompts without enabling
TUI startup, mirror supported dialogs, and reconcile ownership at session
boundaries. Keep default-off RPC and interactive presentation unchanged.

Initial relay failure and terminal host faults exit for supervisor recovery.
Transient relay and registry faults keep their existing authenticated retry
lifecycles; publisher security failures remain latched.

